    "Custom DNS (stored only)": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DNS kustom (hanya disimpan)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS URLSession cannot override DNS per app, so a custom DNS value is stored for reference only and does not change resolution.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URLSession iOS tidak bisa mengganti DNS per aplikasi, jadi nilai DNS kustom hanya disimpan sebagai referensi dan tidak mengubah resolusi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keys stay in this app's settings file on this device. Debrid is experimental in the desktop app too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kunci hanya tersimpan di berkas pengaturan aplikasi ini di perangkat ini. Debrid juga masih eksperimental di aplikasi desktop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plain HTTP on trusted home Wi-Fi only, while the app is in the foreground. The desktop remote uses HTTPS pairing; that pairing flow is not ported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP biasa hanya di Wi-Fi rumah tepercaya, saat aplikasi di foreground. Remote desktop memakai pairing HTTPS; alur itu tidak diport."
          }
        }
      }
    },
