      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisensi: GPL-3.0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unduh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS cannot wake the phone or shut it down like the desktop scheduler. The window only gates starting/pausing while the app runs, and background downloads are limited by iOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS tidak bisa membangunkan ponsel atau mematikannya seperti penjadwal desktop. Jendela waktu hanya mengatur mulai/jeda saat aplikasi berjalan, dan unduhan background dibatasi iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main UI follows the Language choice (Indonesian and English). Some deep or technical screens are still English; more strings are translated over time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UI utama mengikuti pilihan Bahasa (Indonesia dan Inggris). Sebagian layar teknis masih berbahasa Inggris; terjemahan string lainnya menyusul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not ported: Chrome extensions and the desktop browser native-messaging host (the in-app browser captures downloads itself instead), system tray, wake/shutdown, yt-dlp/ffmpeg video processing, 7z/RAR via 7-Zip, MCP server, CLI switches, DHT/uTP/UPnP torrenting and background seeding, screen-reader-perfect desktop menus. Nothing here pretends those work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidak diport: ekstensi Chrome dan host native-messaging browser desktop (browser di aplikasi menangkap unduhan sendiri), system tray, wake/shutdown, pemrosesan video yt-dlp/ffmpeg, 7z/RAR via 7-Zip, server MCP, switch CLI, torrenting DHT/uTP/UPnP dan seeding background, menu desktop yang sempurna untuk screen reader. Tidak ada yang berpura-pura itu berfungsi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mister Download Manager — iOS port. Original: github.com/anefzaoui/misterdownloadmanager, GPL-3.0, Rust/egui desktop app for Windows/Mac/Linux. This SwiftUI reimplementation keeps the download engine ideas (segmentation, resume, categories, queues, scheduler window, debrid, video grabber, torrent metadata, remote control) within iOS sandbox limits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mister Download Manager — port iOS. Asli: github.com/anefzaoui/misterdownloadmanager, GPL-3.0, aplikasi desktop Rust/egui untuk Windows/Mac/Linux. Reimplementasi SwiftUI ini mempertahankan ide mesin unduh (segmentasi, lanjutkan, kategori, antrean, jendela penjadwal, debrid, pengambil video, metadata torrent, kontrol jarak jauh) dalam batas sandbox iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Site configuration": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurasi situs"
          }
        }
