    "Background dan PiP butuh mode audio di sistem; mematikannya mengembalikan perilaku normal browser (media berhenti saat aplikasi ditutup).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Background and PiP need the system audio mode; turning it off restores normal browser behavior (media stops when the app closes)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalau aktif, tombol DevTools melayang di atas halaman dan entri DevTools muncul di menu ⋯. Panelnya tampil sebagai sheet bawah gaya DevSnoop (Console, Network, Elements, Storage).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the DevTools button floats over the page and a DevTools entry appears in the ⋯ menu. The panel appears as a DevSnoop-style bottom sheet (Console, Network, Elements, Storage)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blokir popup menahan jendela yang dibuka script (window.open); tautan yang diketuk tetap dibuka. Lewati timer mempercepat hitung mundur di halaman download sampai 50x dan mengaktifkan tombol download yang dikunci timer; timer yang ditegakkan server dan verifikasi manusia (mis. Cloudflare) tidak bisa dilewati. Tanpa redirect membuat klik tombol download langsung membuka link finalnya dan membuang popup ke situs lain; popup login/pembayaran yang sah bisa ikut tertahan, matikan kalau perlu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Block popups holds back windows opened by scripts (window.open); tapped links still open. Skip timers speeds up countdowns on download pages up to 50x and enables timer-locked download buttons; server-enforced timers and human verification (e.g. Cloudflare) cannot be skipped. No-redirect makes download button clicks open the final link directly and drops popups to other sites; legitimate login/payment popups can get held back too, turn it off if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username dan kata sandi yang disimpan dari formulir login di browser. Kata sandi hanya tersimpan di Keychain perangkat ini, dan melihat, menyalin, atau mengisinya selalu meminta Face ID (atau kode sandi perangkat).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usernames and passwords saved from login forms in the browser. Passwords are stored only in this device's Keychain, and viewing, copying, or filling them always asks for Face ID (or the device passcode)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menghapus sisa file sementara (.part dan potongan segmen) dari download yang sudah dihapus atau selesai. File .part milik download yang masih antre, jeda, atau gagal dipertahankan agar bisa dilanjutkan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes leftover temporary files (.part and segment chunks) from deleted or finished downloads. .part files of queued, paused, or failed downloads are kept so they can be resumed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filter kustom dan allowlist diatur di panel perisai di dalam browser. The in-app browser runs both AdBlock lists together and captures downloads straight into the queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filter kustom dan allowlist diatur di panel perisai di dalam browser. Browser di aplikasi menjalankan kedua daftar AdBlock bersamaan dan menangkap unduhan langsung ke antrean."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kata sandi": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Situs": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Site"
          }
        }
      }
    },
