    },
    "Hapus login ini": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hapus login ini?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this login?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isi otomatis di halaman ini": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autofill on this page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meminta Face ID, lalu mengisi kolom login di halaman yang sedang dibuka.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests Face ID, then fills the login fields on the open page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Melihat dan menyalin kata sandi memerlukan Face ID (atau kode sandi perangkat).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viewing and copying the password requires Face ID (or the device passcode)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tersalin ke clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied to clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cari situs atau nama pengguna": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search sites or usernames"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kata sandi baru (kosongkan = tidak berubah)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New password (leave empty = unchanged)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kata sandi disimpan di Keychain perangkat ini. Saat mengubah login yang sudah ada, kosongkan kata sandi untuk mempertahankannya.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password is stored in this device's Keychain. When editing an existing login, leave the password empty to keep it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belum ada kata sandi tersimpan. Login di browser, dan saat formulir login dikirim, aplikasi akan menawarkan untuk menyimpannya.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No saved passwords yet. Log in in the browser, and when the login form is submitted, the app will offer to save it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tidak ada login yang cocok dengan pencarian.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No logins match the search."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kata sandi hanya tersimpan di Keychain perangkat ini, tidak pernah dikirim ke mana pun. Melihat, menyalin, dan mengisi login selalu meminta Face ID (atau kode sandi perangkat). Login tidak disimpan dari tab Incognito.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passwords are stored only in this device's Keychain and are never sent anywhere. Viewing, copying, and filling logins always require Face ID (or the device passcode). Logins are not saved from Incognito tabs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(tanpa nama pengguna)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(no username)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
